<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink166-kilavi">
       parattaiyiṟpirinta talaimakaṉviṭa vāyilāyvantārkku avaṉ koṭumaikūṟit tōḻi iyaṟpaḻittavaḻit talaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
           Spoken by the heroine, when the confidante spoke of [his] cruelty so that [she] leaves the hero who [now] had separated from the other woman, to him [the hero] who [just] entered [the house].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink167">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>yiruṅkaḻi yiṉakkeṭi ṟārun tuṟaiva</l>
<l>ṉalkuvaṉ pōlak kūṟi</l>
<l>nalkā ṉāyiṉun tolkē ḷaṉṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man from the shore where the small, white crow of the vast seashore</l>
        <l>Fills [itself] up with the Keṭiṟu fish in schools in the dark backwaters - </l>
        <l>Having spoken like one who bestows [love upon me];</l>
        <l>Although he is not a bestower [of love],</l>
        <l>He is an old friend.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
